      "updated": 1788194043132,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "decided by LALMs in agentic systems : use LALMs to answer one task directly N times,\nif the N answers are the same and correct,tag it with “直接回答题”,otherwise \"收集证据题\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "decided by LALMs in agentic systems : use LALMs to answer one task directly N times,\nif the N answers are the same and correct,tag it with “直接回答题”,otherwise \"收集证据题\"",
